---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const contactEmail = 'chesterbeard@salishseaconsulting.com';
const lastUpdated = 'September 11, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use · HarvestMap"
  description="The plain-English terms for using HarvestMap, including accuracy disclaimers and limitations of liability."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: var(--space-7); max-width: 760px;">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Ground rules</span>
      <h1 class="squiggle squiggle-berry">Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="lead">Readable, not legalese. Using HarvestMap means you accept the few simple terms below.</p>
      <p class="honesty-note" style="text-align: left; margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
      <h2 style="margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2);">Content accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        HarvestMap is a directory built from public sources and community submissions. We work hard to keep it accurate, but
        farms change their hours, crops, and availability all the time. Seasonal availability is estimated — it is not
        guaranteed. Always call ahead before visiting a farm, and treat everything here as a starting point, not a promise.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2);">User conduct</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a farm listing or a "what's ripe" update, you agree to provide accurate information that is yours to
        share. Don't submit spam, misleading details, or someone else's farm without the right to do so. We review every
        submission and may edit or decline it at our discretion.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2);">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The HarvestMap name, design, and original written content are owned by Salish Sea Consulting and may not be copied or
        republished without permission. Farm listings themselves are factual directory information. Farm photos belong to
        their respective owners and are used for identification purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2);">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        HarvestMap is provided "as is." We are not responsible for the accuracy of any listing, the condition of any farm, or
        anything that happens during your visit to a listed location. You use the directory at your own discretion, and we
        won't be liable for any loss or inconvenience that results from relying on the information here.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-2);">Questions</h2>
      <p>
        If anything here is unclear, email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
